            "code": "measure-word-ge",
            "title": "How Many? (几 + 个)",
            "simpleExplanation": "个 (gè) is Chinese's all-purpose measure word — when in doubt, use it. Numbers can't attach directly to nouns; you need a measure word between them: 三个人 (sān gè rén) = three people, not 三人. To ask \"how many\" for small, countable amounts, use 几 (jǐ) + measure word: 你家有几口人? = How many people are in your family?",
